            <p class="CiteTOC"><a rel="cgi/extract.pl?page=html/Burlington18/Burlington1802.html&amp;anchor=18-41" href="/VT/Burlington/#!/Burlington18/Burlington1802.html#18-41" class="basic">18-41&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Reserved.</a></p>

